Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver metapackage (Fermi, Kepler (GeForce 400/500/600/700 series))
 The 390.157 driver from the NVIDIA 390xx legacy series, repackaged as a
 reproducible build for focal.
 .
 Supported hardware: Fermi, Kepler (GeForce 400/500/600/700 series).
 .
 UPSTREAM STATUS: Upstream EOL 2022-12. Community-patched for newer kernels/Xorg.

Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-libs
Architecture: amd64
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Provides: nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-libs-nonglvnd
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — core runtime libraries
 Shared libraries used by the NVIDIA 390.157 driver: libnvidia-glcore,
 libnvidia-tls, libnvidia-eglcore and friends. Install the :i386 variant
 alongside for 32-bit OpenGL applications.

Package: nvidia-legacy-390xx-driver-bin
Architecture: amd64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: NVIDIA legacy 390.157 driver — utilities
 nvidia-smi, nvidia-settings' backend, nvidia-xconfig, nvidia-debugdump and
 the nvidia-persistenced daemon for the 390.157 driver.

